        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:2.0:WirelessText</valueName>
            <value>Environment Canada: TORNADO in this mobile coverage area.
Take immediate cover in a basement or interior room if weather threat approaches. Shelter from flying debris if outside.
Tornado Warning, 12:18 p.m. EDT Saturday 18 July
</value>
